{"id":"d1d6caf42abe4955","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-seq-pointwise-limit-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Seq Pointwise Limit Sequence","display":"df-zfc-seq-pointwise-limit-sequence — ZFC Seq Pointwise Limit Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-seq-pointwise-limit-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-seq-pointwise-limit-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-seq-pointwise-limit-sequence — ZFC Seq Pointwise Limit Sequence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-metric]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-seq-pointwise-limit-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-seq-pointwise-limit-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-seq-pointwise-limit-sequence — ZFC Seq Pointwise Limit Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"58-df-metric\">58-df-metric</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,f,X,Y,d\\in V\">\\(g,f,X,Y,d\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Metric}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"58-df-metric\">58-df-metric</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqPointwiseLimitSequence}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqPointwiseLimitSequence}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}limit\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqPointwiseLimitSequence}_S(g,f,X,Y,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,Y)\\land \\mathrm{Function}(g,X,Y)\n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,Y^X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(n\\geq N\\to d(\\langle f(n)(x),g(x)\\rangle)&lt;\\epsilon\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}limit\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqPointwiseLimitSequence}_S(g,f,X,Y,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,Y)\\land \\mathrm{Function}(g,X,Y)\n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,Y^X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(n\\geq N\\to d(\\langle f(n)(x),g(x)\\rangle)&lt;\\epsilon\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>点态极限中的两个箭头均展开为已导入的集合函数谓词，避免把类型标注误当作对象语言公式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"li